ras":["Studies **suggest** that quick judgements **tend to** be confident but not always correct. **Having tested** 200 volunteers, researchers found that a short pause **may be enough** to reduce errors. Results **are subject to** replication, however.","Participants **were told** to give reasons; this **should have been** easy, yet many **could not articulate** them. The team therefore **zeroed in on** training. A follow-up **is expected to be published** next year."],"kicker":"SUMMARY","by":"Reasoning Lab","gloss":[["judgement","julgamento"],["pause","pausa"],["replication","replicação"],["follow-up","acompanhamento"]]}]},{"tag":"Compreensão","title":"Did you understand?","blocks":[{"type":"tfng","title":"","items":[{"q":"Quick judgements are always correct.","ans":"F","why":"not always correct."},{"q":"A short pause may reduce errors.","ans":"T","why":"may be enough."},{"q":"A follow-up is expected next year.","ans":"T","why":"next year."}]},{"type":"mcq","title":"Vocabulary in context","items":[{"q":"“articulate” (verbo) = ?","opts":["expressar com clareza","articular peça","argumentar só"],"ans":0,"why":"articulate."},{"q":"“replication” = ?","opts":["replicação","religião","revisão"],"ans":0,"why":"replication."}]}]},{"tag":"Gramática","title":"Grammar recap","blocks":[{"type":"table","head":["Verifique","Exemplo"],"rows":[["Uso **hedging** com precisão?","**suggest**, **tend to**, **may**"],["Uso **passiva modal** (presente e passado)?","**should have been** easy; **is expected to be published**"],["Uso **oração participial**?","**Having tested** 200 volunteers…"],["Uso **be subject to**?","Results **are subject to** replication"],["Uso **zero in on**, **weigh in on**, **bring up**?","The team **zeroed in on** training"]],"cap":"Autoavaliação da Unidade 13"}]},{"tag":"Prática","title":"Practice · Mixed review","blocks":[{"type":"gap","title":"Complete the sentences (from the unit)","bank":null,"items":[{"s":"We use mental ___ , and often that’s fine. (shortcuts)","a":"shortcuts","why":"ideia do áudio."},{"s":"Does your writing ___ too much? (claim)","a":"claim","why":"claim."},{"s":"Volunteers ___ randomly assigned to groups. (be)","a":"are","why":"passiva."},{"s":"I used to ___ in on the first option. (zero)","a":"zero","why":"phrasal verb."},{"s":"The plot ___ summarised in one line. (can)","a":"can be","why":"modal passivo."},{"s":"The scene ___ place in a school hall. (take)","a":"takes","why":"cenário."}]},{"type":"match","title":"Match the word to its meaning","pairs":[["decision-making","tomada de decisão"],["heuristic","heurística"],["cognitive load","carga cognitiva"],["checklist routine","rotina de checklist"],["devil’s advocate","advogado do diabo"],["costly mistake","erro custoso"]]}]},{"tag":"Vocabulário","title":"Unit word bank","blocks":[{"type":"words","items":[["decision-making","tomada de decisão"],["heuristic","heurística"],["cognitive load","carga cognitiva"],["checklist routine","rotina de checklist"],["devil’s advocate","advogado do diabo"],["costly mistake","erro custoso"],["under pressure","sob pressão"],["bias awareness","consciência de vieses"],["debiasing training","treinamento de redução de vieses"],["pre-mortem","pré-mortem"],["decision journal","diário de decisões"],["snap decision","decisão relâmpago"],["bounded rationality","racionalidade limitada"],["gut instinct","instinto"],["inferred meaning","sentido inferido"],["listening trap","armadilha de escuta"],["cautious optimism","otimismo cauteloso"],["speaker’s hedge","suavização do falante"],["all-inclusive","all-inclusive"],["attitude","attitude"],["runway","runway"],["alteration","alteration"],["workshop leaflet","folheto de oficina"],["one-day course","curso de um dia"],["writing trainer","instrutor de escrita"],["calibrated claim","afirmação calibrada"],["overpromise","prometer demais"],["puffery","exagero publicitário"],["disclaimer","aviso de isenção"],["testimonial quote","depoimento citado"],["limited places","vagas limitadas"],[